# Harpy candidate: transient files (the parent .gitignore only matches */*/work/ etc.)
*/work/
*/pipeline/work/
*/pipeline/.staging/
*/pipeline/run.lock
*.blend1
# Stage logs are evidence (cited in docs/art-pipeline/harpy-candidate-report.*): re-include them against the
# root rule `*.log`. work/ stays excluded above, so logs inside it are not re-included.
!*/logs/*.log
# H2 Tripo originals (44-77 MB each, >50 MB policy): not committed, pinned by sha256/bytes in
# source-specs/tripo-<task8>-h2.json and 20260929-h2-tripo/reports/tripo-run.json.
20260929-h2-tripo/source/*-tex8k-pbr.glb
20260929-h2-tripo/source/*-parts*.glb
# H2 4K master textures: kept local (reproducible from the local build, sha256 pinned in
# 20260929-h2-bake/reports/textures-report.json); the 2K runtime set is committed.
20260929-h2-bake/textures/master_4k/
20260929-h2-bake/textures/4k/
20260929-h2-bake/textures/*_4K.png
# H3 Tripo originals (Harpy regen bca735a3), same policy as H2: local only, pinned by sha256.
20260929-h3-tripo/source/*.glb
# H3 4K master textures: kept local (reproducible from the local build, sha256 pinned in
# 20260929-h3-bake/reports/textures-report.json); the 2K runtime set is committed.
20260929-h3-bake/textures/4k/
# H3 look-dev v2 (20260929-h3-lookdev): 4K masters local (sha256 in reports/ld-maps-report.json, byte-reproducible by
# lookdev_maps.py, reports/determinism.json); the 2K runtime set, LUT, overrides, base 1K, FBX, reports, sheets committed.
20260929-h3-lookdev/textures/4k/
